{
  "id": "gov.ifms.gia-uc",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "name": {
    "en": "Grant-in-aid release and utilisation certificates",
    "hi": "सहायता अनुदान विमुक्ति और उपयोगिता प्रमाण पत्र"
  },
  "domain": "IFMS",
  "description": "Release check by DMN (unspent balance, recurring grant 75 % rule, UC status, EAT use), FA, sanction, release bill through gov.ifms.bill, then a UC case per grant with the profile deadline (12 months after the year), reminders and blacklisting; UC form by grantee type (12-A / 12-B / 12-C); assets register flag.",
